## chart main Smart Goal Gantt
```mermaid
gantt
  title Smart Goal Tracker - Replace With Project Goal
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat  %b %d

  section Now: Reality
  P0 Reality Check        :crit, reality-check, 2026-05-03, 1d
  Wiki Direction          :active, wiki-direction, 2026-05-03, 1d
  Build-vs-Clone Calls    :bvc, after wiki-direction, 1d

  section Goal Contract
  P0 Goal Contract        :crit, goal-contract, after reality-check, 1d
  Success Criteria        :criteria, after goal-contract, 1d
  Tracker Baseline        :milestone, baseline, after criteria, 0d

  section Plan Space
  Domain Plan or Describe :active, plan, after baseline, 2d
  P0 Plan-Space Ambition  :crit, ambition, after plan, 2d
  Beads Baseline          :beads, after ambition, 1d

  section Execution Waves
  P1 Wave 1               :wave1, after beads, 4d
  P1 Hardening 1          :crit, harden1, after wave1, 2d
  P1 Reality Recheck      :milestone, recheck1, after harden1, 0d
  P2 Wave 2               :wave2, after recheck1, 5d
  P2 UX Refinement        :ux, after wave2, 3d
  P2 Hardening 2          :crit, harden2, after ux, 2d
  P2 Proof Gate           :milestone, proof-gate, after harden2, 0d

  section Finish
  Docs and Examples       :docs, after proof-gate, 2d
  Final Polish Round      :polish, after docs, 2d
  Commit and Reality Check:crit, final-check, after polish, 1d
  Lofty Goal Met          :milestone, goal-met, after final-check, 0d
```

## chart goal-contract Lofty Goal Contract
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  now["CURRENT: reality-check baseline"]
  gaps["GAPS: implementation, proof, UX, performance, docs"]
  goal["LOFTY END GOAL: polished, tested, refined, useful"]
  bars["QUALITY BARS: unit, e2e, mutation or CRAP, accessibility, docs"]
  proof["DONE: validation, commit, post-commit reality check agrees"]

  now --> gaps --> goal --> bars --> proof

  classDef current fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:2px
  classDef gap fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef goal fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef proof fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  class now current
  class gaps gap
  class goal,bars goal
  class proof proof
```

## chart reality-gap Current Reality and Gap Evidence
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  docs["Docs vision"]
  code["Code reality"]
  beads["Bead coverage"]
  wiki["Wiki direction"]
  gap["TRACKER BASELINE"]

  docs --> gap
  code --> gap
  beads --> gap
  wiki --> gap

  gap --> working["OK: working now"]
  gap --> partial["MED: partial or unproven"]
  gap --> blocked["HIGH: blockers"]
  gap --> missing["HIGH: no bead or no proof"]

  classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
  classDef med fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
  classDef high fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef neutral fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
  class docs,code,beads,wiki,gap neutral
  class working ok
  class partial med
  class blocked,missing high
```

## chart routing Planning and Skill Routing
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  start["Start from current reality"]
  wiki{"Could wiki guidance steer this?"}
  bvc["Apply build-vs-clone placement calls"]
  criteria{"Are pass/fail criteria unclear?"}
  domain{"Is this multi-repo or domain-slice work?"}
  describe["Use describe"]
  planner["Use domain-planner"]
  mmdx["Create MMDX Gantt stack"]
  beads["Create Beads via divide-and-conquer"]

  start --> wiki
  wiki -->|yes| bvc
  wiki -->|no| bvc
  bvc --> criteria
  criteria -->|yes| describe --> mmdx
  criteria -->|no| domain
  domain -->|yes| planner --> mmdx
  domain -->|no| mmdx
  mmdx --> beads

  classDef decision fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef action fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
  class wiki,criteria,domain decision
  class start,bvc,describe,planner,mmdx,beads action
```

## chart ambition-loop Plan-Space Ambition and Refinement
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  baseline["Reality baseline"]
  first["First goal contract"]
  ambition1["Ambition round 1: raise the ceiling"]
  ambition2["Ambition round 2: remove incrementalism"]
  depth["Domain-specific depth"]
  tasks["Beads with dependencies"]
  refine["Refinement rounds until no meaningful gaps"]
  frontier["Ready implementation frontier"]

  baseline --> first --> ambition1 --> ambition2 --> depth --> tasks --> refine --> frontier

  classDef current fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ambition fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764,stroke-width:2px
  classDef ready fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
  class baseline,first current
  class ambition1,ambition2,depth,refine ambition
  class tasks,frontier ready
```

## chart hardening-loop Recurring Smart Hardening Loop
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Describe
  Describe --> Reproduce
  Reproduce --> RiskScore
  RiskScore --> Implement
  Implement --> Tests
  Tests --> RealityCheck
  RealityCheck --> NextWave: gaps remain
  RealityCheck --> ProofGate: evidence passes
  NextWave --> Describe
  ProofGate --> [*]
```

## chart ux-refinement User Experience Refinement Loop
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  workflow["Target-user workflow pass"]
  polish["Interaction and copy polish"]
  visual["Visual consistency and responsive proof"]
  a11y["Accessibility and keyboard proof"]
  e2e["E2E or screenshot proof"]
  recheck["Reality check UX claims"]

  workflow --> polish --> visual --> a11y --> e2e --> recheck
```

## chart proof-gate Final Proof Gate
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  tests["All relevant tests pass"]
  e2e["E2E flows prove the core experience"]
  risk["Risk score or mutation gaps addressed"]
  docs["Docs and examples match reality"]
  commit["Commit if authorized"]
  reality["Post-commit reality check agrees"]
  done["LOFTY GOAL MET"]

  tests --> e2e --> risk --> docs --> commit --> reality --> done

  classDef required fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:3px
  class tests,e2e,risk,docs,commit,reality required
  class done done
```
